  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can make your speech intelligible to any creature. As a Magic action, choose one or more creatures within 60 feet of you, up to a number equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one). For 1 hour, the chosen creatures can magically understand you, whatever language you speak. Once you use this feature, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest, unless you expend a spell slot of any level to use it again.</p>",
